  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: 'He leans on his hand and grins at you instead of the board. You pretend to read your textbook, but your cheeks are warm.'
